I was unable to find any reliable evidence that identifies a writer and biographer who meets all of the detailed conditions given:

* authoring multiple books including an autobiography;  
* writing a biography of their father published in 1980;  
* falling in love with the brother of a philosopher who was the eighth child in the philosopher’s family;  
* being divorced and remarried in the 1940s.

None of the accessible sources provided any of these pieces of information, and no credible biographical record links a single individual to all of those facts. Therefore, the pseudonym and identity of such a writer remain unknown based on the evidence available.
